WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — time-as-an-index (zu) · microsoft-edge-neural

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.153
<v Narrator>Okuqala, ngaphakathi kwe-mathematical time loop, cishe yonke i-digital lock izophula ngasikhathi sinye ngaphandle kwe-one-time secret pad.

2
00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:23.638
<v Narrator>Okulandelayo, empilweni yangaphandle eyaziwayo, akukho lutho oluthile lwe-quantum, i-analog circuit, noma ukungqubuzana okuthunyelwe kuthumela izimpendulo ezifundeka emuva ngesikhathi.

3
00:00:23.718 --> 00:00:35.290
<v Narrator>Yesibili, yonke ukubuka kuqala okukhawulelwe kwesinqumo esizayo yimisebenzi ekhokhelwa phambilini, okungukuthi amaxabiso amasha angahleliwe anqobe ngokushesha.
